  "timecoded_text_to_speech": [
    {
      "end": "00:00:04.963",
      "start": "00:00:00.000",
      "text": " My question is mainly aimed for Eliza and Bob."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:10.969",
      "start": "00:00:04.963",
      "text": " What's your guys' opinion on Bellamy and Clark's relationship romantically?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:15.974",
      "start": "00:00:13.972",
      "text": " That's a fan of Bellark."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:16.975",
      "start": "00:00:15.974",
      "text": " Are we going to?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:18.977",
      "start": "00:00:16.975",
      "text": " Oh, I'm going to take my name."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:21.980",
      "start": "00:00:20.979",
      "text": " Just the love."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.982",
      "start": "00:00:21.980",
      "text": " That's what we love when we last hear that Bellark."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:24.983",
      "start": "00:00:23.982",
      "text": " Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:25.984",
      "start": "00:00:24.983",
      "text": " Just favorite."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:28.987",
      "start": "00:00:25.984",
      "text": " What do you think about the hardcore Bellark shippers?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:30.989",
      "start": "00:00:28.987",
      "text": " Does any of that surprise you?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:34.993",
      "start": "00:00:30.989",
      "text": " It was surprising to me the whole Bellamy and Clark reaction."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:39.998",
      "start": "00:00:34.993",
      "text": " I didn't think that it would be quite so strong, but it was cool."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:44.962",
      "start": "00:00:39.998",
      "text": " Look, I think that that is something that people saw in the show"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:46.964",
      "start": "00:00:44.962",
      "text": " that we didn't necessarily write."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:50.968",
      "start": "00:00:46.964",
      "text": " I think they make a, you know, they're a good team."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:53.971",
      "start": "00:00:50.968",
      "text": " Yeah, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:56.974",
      "start": "00:00:53.971",
      "text": " Everybody's always asking us about Bellamy."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:59.977",
      "start": "00:00:56.974",
      "text": " They ask me about him a lot as well."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:00.978",
      "start": "00:00:59.977",
      "text": " Let me tell you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:03.981",
      "start": "00:01:00.978",
      "text": " Is there going to be some movements as far as closer?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:05.983",
      "start": "00:01:03.981",
      "text": " You guys, you know what?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:08.986",
      "start": "00:01:05.983",
      "text": " I think there's a lot more on their minds."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:10.988",
      "start": "00:01:08.986",
      "text": " I mean, they were a good team."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:14.992",
      "start": "00:01:10.988",
      "text": " I don't know, like, romantically not so much, but, you know."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:18.996",
      "start": "00:01:14.992",
      "text": " Do you think there's any hope for Bellamy and Clark?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:20.998",
      "start": "00:01:18.996",
      "text": " Oh, my God."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:23.959",
      "start": "00:01:20.998",
      "text": " Do I love Bellark?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:25.961",
      "start": "00:01:23.959",
      "text": " Oh, God."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:29.965",
      "start": "00:01:26.962",
      "text": " You know what?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:34.970",
      "start": "00:01:29.965",
      "text": " It's complicated."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:42.978",
      "start": "00:01:34.970",
      "text": " I love working with Bob, and I love our platonic relationship on the show."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:45.981",
      "start": "00:01:42.978",
      "text": " I think it's great."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:50.986",
      "start": "00:01:45.981",
      "text": " But the whole shipping thing I'm not really accustomed to, I don't really get that."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:52.988",
      "start": "00:01:50.986",
      "text": " I think it's..."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:58.994",
      "start": "00:01:53.989",
      "text": " But romantically, I don't see it in, like, the pairing in that way."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:01.997",
      "start": "00:01:58.994",
      "text": " That's the way I see it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:05.000",
      "start": "00:02:01.997",
      "text": " We want to think outside the box."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:06.960",
      "start": "00:02:05.000",
      "text": " Yeah, maybe no Bellark for now."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:09.963",
      "start": "00:02:06.960",
      "text": " Bellark!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:12.966",
      "start": "00:02:09.963",
      "text": " Oh, God."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:14.968",
      "start": "00:02:12.966",
      "text": " You've been working the beast."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:16.970",
      "start": "00:02:14.968",
      "text": " You want more? Do you really?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:19.973",
      "start": "00:02:16.970",
      "text": " Thank you for telling us really right now."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:22.976",
      "start": "00:02:20.974",
      "text": " We pick it up."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:26.980",
      "start": "00:02:22.976",
      "text": " I don't know if there's much room for romance."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:29.983",
      "start": "00:02:26.980",
      "text": " Having said that, you never know."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:32.986",
      "start": "00:02:29.983",
      "text": " I just want to know if either of you ship Clarkson?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:36.990",
      "start": "00:02:32.986",
      "text": " I mean, yeah, I think it's really cool."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:44.998",
      "start": "00:02:36.990",
      "text": " I heard recently that I am the first lead character on a network show to be bisexual,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:46.958",
      "start": "00:02:44.998",
      "text": " which I think is amazing."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:47.959",
      "start": "00:02:46.958",
      "text": " That's cool."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:49.961",
      "start": "00:02:47.959",
      "text": " I know, right?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:50.962",
      "start": "00:02:49.961",
      "text": " Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:53.965",
      "start": "00:02:50.962",
      "text": " I hope that's true."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:54.966",
      "start": "00:02:53.965",
      "text": " By the way, it's cool."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:56.968",
      "start": "00:02:54.966",
      "text": " Either way."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:00.972",
      "start": "00:02:56.968",
      "text": " But yeah, so for that reason alone, I absolutely do."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:06.978",
      "start": "00:03:00.972",
      "text": " If Clarkson likes to reunite it, I mean, I hope that Alicia's coming back for season three,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:10.982",
      "start": "00:03:06.978",
      "text": " because I really think that would be a fascinating arc in the story."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:16.988",
      "start": "00:03:10.982",
      "text": " I suppose there's hope for reconciliation because Alicia Devonum carries coming back to the show."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:24.996",
      "start": "00:03:18.990",
      "text": " But I think when they come together for the first time, there'll be fireworks in a way that we haven't seen before,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:26.998",
      "start": "00:03:24.996",
      "text": " because Clark is pissed."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:27.999",
      "start": "00:03:26.998",
      "text": " Really pissed."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:30.961",
      "start": "00:03:27.999",
      "text": " I mean, she really messed it up."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:33.964",
      "start": "00:03:30.961",
      "text": " She had a really good thing going."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:36.967",
      "start": "00:03:33.964",
      "text": " I mean, it's Clark."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:41.972",
      "start": "00:03:36.967",
      "text": " Did I enjoy kissing Alexa?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:47.978",
      "start": "00:03:42.973",
      "text": " Well, she's a really good friend of mine, and it was kind of weird doing it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:48.979",
      "start": "00:03:47.978",
      "text": " But you know what?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:51.982",
      "start": "00:03:48.979",
      "text": " I think the end result was really good."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:54.985",
      "start": "00:03:51.982",
      "text": " So, who else to us?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:02.993",
      "start": "00:03:54.985",
      "text": " I love that we are making a show about a world when people love other people,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:05.996",
      "start": "00:04:02.993",
      "text": " and it doesn't matter what gender."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:06.997",
      "start": "00:04:05.996",
      "text": " That's great."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:07.998",
      "start": "00:04:06.997",
      "text": " Okay, thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:15.964",
      "start": "00:04:07.998",
      "text": " Yeah, I think that's going to be really interesting to see how they butt heads or not."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:19.968",
      "start": "00:04:15.964",
      "text": " I didn't say how I felt about ClickSum, but I think you summed it up perfectly."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:20.969",
      "start": "00:04:19.968",
      "text": " Thank you."
